<title>ESTONIA: ESTIKO APPOINTS NEW BOARD MEMBER.</title>
<headline>ESTIKO APPOINTS NEW BOARD MEMBER.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Estiko, a packaging materials maker and retail centre owner, said it has appointed Virve Parve as a member of its group's management board from June 16.</p>
<p>In a statement the company said that Parve will replace Martti Tiidelepp, who left the company June 15.</p>
<p>Parve, 56, is presently the managing director of Estiko- Plaster, one of Estiko's subsidiaries.</p>
<p>-- David Mardiste, Tallinn newsroom +372 620 9202 reuters@reuters.ee</p>
</text>
